1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Today I will introduce a small technique for changing the version.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Now I see a set of clothes that we have made.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I want to adjust the shirt.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:29,000
You can add the modified shirt version in.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
You can see the straight line of the version after the modification.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The number of straight lines of the original version is different.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Now the condition of the version replacement is no longer limited by the number of straight lines.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
You can replace it directly.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Next, we will start the replacement of the version.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Select the original version.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Right-click to replace.

12
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Select the version after heavy adjustment.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Then select the corresponding points one by one.

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Press the return button to replace.

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Then replace the original version in the same way.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Here we will save the version that has been added.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
The replacement is to adjust the position of the straight line point of the version.

18
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Curve, cut, base line, version name and code information.

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Sewing line, internal shape, sticker, fabric, name line, draw and button as the properties of the original version are retained.

20
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Here you can modify it.

21
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Adjust the shape of the clothing.

22
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Here you can modify the design of the front of the clothing.

23
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Adjust the size of the clothing.

24
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Adjust the length of the clothing.

25
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Adjust the size of the clothing.

26
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:41,000
This is our replacement function introduction.

27
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Thank you for watching.

